Package: devjam-science-opensesame-psychopy-dev
Version: 1.0-1
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: devjam-science-tools (>= 2.5-1)
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: OpenSesame Launcher with the PsychoPy dev environment
 Desktop launchers for OpenSesame and Sigmund Analyst in the PsychoPy
 dev environment in /opt/psychopy/PsychoPy-dev, made with
 "install-psychopy-opensesame --dev" (Python 3.13, PsychoPy from its git
 dev branch, the dev-jam plugins from git). For testing next to
 devjam-science-opensesame-psychopy, not for data collection. It includes
 an OpenSesame launcher that runs as a user service with real-time
 priority; in experiment mode that OpenSesame runs on the isolated CPU
 cores.
 .
 opensesamerun-psychopy-dev runs an experiment without the GUI in the
 dev environment. It needs the Experiment Manager plugin there.
 .
 There is no PsychoPy launcher: the dev environment has no psychopy_app,
 so the PsychoPy GUI does not start.
